            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SnackTray 1.4.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Press Esc while dragging a window to hide the zones. The window keeps following your cursor and stays wherever you let go, without snapping. This works with right-click drag too, where Esc used to send the window back to where it started.</li>
</ul>
